  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORCAP Strategic Humanitarian Partnership/Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of humanitarian personell on short notice to the United Nation and other organisations strengthening their capacity to efficiently protect lives and livelihood of affected populations in crisis. The aim of the support is to enhance renewable energy access for vulnerable populations and institutions: Contribute to the protection, resilience and recovery of displaced and host communities, as well as to be the driver in decarbonising humanitarian operations.</narrative>
  </description>
